# Binary files are never text. This repository has already lost two of them to
# a text channel - src/assets/portrait.webp, and all three CV PDFs - and the
# damage is invisible until something tries to decompress them. Git is not what
# broke them, but it is the one place the rule can be written once and applied
# to every clone and every tool that respects it.
*.pdf   -text -diff
*.webp  -text -diff
*.png   -text -diff
*.jpg   -text -diff
*.jpeg  -text -diff
*.woff2 -text -diff
*.mp3   -text -diff
*.mp4   -text -diff
